# Install as /etc/drama-youtube/unified-writer.env, owner root:root, mode 0644.
# The two referenced secret files must be regular non-symlink files owned by
# drama-youtube:drama-youtube with exact mode 0600.
# DB JSON contains exactly host/port/user/password/database: fixed
# 101.32.56.53:63353, ads_aius, ads_ai, with the existing password preserved.
# No account creation/GRANT/ALTER is required or performed. The existing DB
# account is shared and broader than this feature; SQL is restricted by the
# application to these three already-created tables only:
# ads_ai.ads_youtube_videos, ads_ai.ads_youtube_comments,
# ads_ai.ads_youtube_publish_log. No SQL may target the original schema.
# Health v3 reports shared-existing-account/application-table-allowlist and
# db_least_privilege=false; it must not be described as DB least privilege.
DRAMA_YOUTUBE_UNIFIED_RPC_HOST=127.0.0.1
DRAMA_YOUTUBE_UNIFIED_RPC_PORT=18837
DRAMA_YOUTUBE_UNIFIED_RPC_TOKEN_FILE=/etc/drama-youtube/unified-rpc-server.token
DRAMA_YOUTUBE_WRITER_DB_CREDENTIAL_FILE=/etc/drama-youtube/writer-db.json
